# Play test of Varuna Point Remade (CIPlay varuna_point_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# landing on the north-east sand shelf, the ramp up to the site (10 m), the floodlight tower's deck (16.3 m), the four
# crates on the reef (2 to 7 m down), the deep under the point (11.6 m down).
island Varuna Point Remade
offset -0.7903 -5.1702
expect step 0
expect title Floodlight Down

# From the landing up the ramp to the construction site: the foreman's log on his desk by the office steps
walk 44 20 to 40 16 to 38 14 to 32.8 10 to 25 4 to 16 -1 h=10
zone site
expect step 0
read Foreman's log
expect step 1

# RAFT REMADE 10-26: the surveyors' camp and their report, Varuna's Back and the fuse in the crane cab, the secrets
zone surveycamp
expect step 2
read Surveyors' report
expect step 3
expect hidden surveycache
use Survey lamp 1
use Survey lamp 3
wait 1
expect shown surveycache
open Surveyors' cache
zone backfoot
zone craneback
expect step 4
open Crane cab box
expect story fuse 1
expect step 5
use Hard hat 1
use Hard hat 2
use Hard hat 3
use Hard hat 4
use Hard hat 5
wait 1
expect message All five hard hats
expect item TitaniumIngot 1
zone hiddencave
open Cave strongbox
open Company plane's crate
open Gravel barge's crate
zone jump_vp_finale
open Concrete gang's tin

# The floodlight's four parts from the crates round the point
at 40 28.5 h=-2
open Lens crate
at 24 28.5 h=-2
open Bulb crate
expect step 6
at 71 -10.5 h=-2
open Reflector crate
at 16 -28.5 h=-3
open Cable crate
expect story part 4
expect step 7

# Up the floodlight tower's ladder to its deck; the floodlight lit again
climb 17.5 -1.6 h=10
zone lightdeck
expect step 8
use floodlight
expect message hums
expect story part 0

# The deep under the point: the giant angler, and the foreman's strongbox it guarded
at 18 67
zone deep
kill Angler fish
expect step 9
reach Foreman's strongbox
open Foreman's strongbox
wait 5
expect item Blueprint_WindTurbine 1
expect item Blueprint_ElectricGrill 1
expect done
